hema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How does Explee work?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Explee’s AI agent finds your B2B buyers and sends them cold emails for you. Give it your website, and it learns what you sell and who’s likely to buy it. Then it writes to each lead, follows up, and stays within your daily budget. When a lead asks for a call, the agent sends them your booking link.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Will it work for my business?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, if you sell to other businesses. To check your niche, enter your website at the top of this page, and the free demo will show you who the agent would contact.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I really get $30 free? Why do you need my card?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, you get $30 in free credits when you set up billing. We only ask for a card to verify it. Once the credits run out, you only pay for emails sent, within your daily budget. Your bank may show a temporary $1 hold for the check, which is released on its own.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How much does Explee cost?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Finding leads is free, and each email sent costs about $0.04. Your $30 in credits covers roughly your first 750 emails. After that, you pay per email sent, up to a daily budget you can change at any time. We charge your card only for emails already sent, usually in batches of $5 or more.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which countries and languages can I target?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"You can target leads in any country or state. You can also target a city if we know where the company is located. The agent writes to each lead in their own language when we support it, or you can choose one of 30 languages yourself.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Whose mailboxes send the emails? Will they land in spam?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Emails are sent from our pre-warmed mailboxes, not from your company domain, so your domain’s reputation isn’t at risk. Every mailbox has SPF, DKIM, and DMARC set up, and we pause any mailbox that gets blocklisted or has too many bounces.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where do the leads come from?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"From our database of 105M+ companies and their decision-makers. The agent picks leads by industry, role, company size, and location, and emails only addresses that pass our verification checks. Already have a list? After you sign up, upload it as a CSV, and the agent will email every contact that passes the same checks.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What results can I expect?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Many customers get their first hot leads within 24 hours, using only the free credits. The median cost per hot lead is $9. A hot lead is any reply that moves the deal forward, like “Send me pricing” or “Talk to my CTO,” even if no call has been booked yet.\"}}]}2b:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"section\":\"faq\",\"landing\":\"test2\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-[720px] mx-auto\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$40\"}}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-center mb-12\",\"children\":\"$L41\"}],\"$L42\"]}]]}]}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"cta-section\",\"className\":\"flex items-end justify-center mb-8!\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{\"section\":\"cta\",\"landing\":\"test2\"}],[\"$\",\"$L43\",null,{\"trialCreditUsd\":30}]]}]}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"$L44\",null,{}]\n45:I[95589,[\"/_next/static/chunks/34ug4cgpfi0f0.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2po309211zkhf.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1gqc2mcx8